!! 签名链模型

咏唱证明的核心是签名链，一个按生成顺序排列的签名数组。

```ts
export interface ChantProof {
  proofId: string;
  sessionId: string;
  paramsHash: string;
  environmentHash: string;
  signatures: ChantSignature[];
}
```

!! 签名结构

每个签名记录完整的血缘和时序信息：

```ts
export interface ChantSignature {
  index: number;
  kind: WatermarkKind;
  stage: ChantStage;

  producer: {
    objectId: string;
    classId: string;
    modulePath: string;
    sourceRef: SourceRef;
  };

  lineage: {
    inputIds: string[];
    outputId: string;
    consumedBy?: string;
    sourceRefs: SourceRef[];
  };

  evidence: {
    eventTopic?: string;
    windowId?: string;
    stateTransition?: string;
    pipelineStep?: string;
    decoratorSlot?: string;
    factorySource?: string;
  };

  quality: number;
}
```

!! 水印类型

```ts
type WatermarkKind =
  | 'observer'
  | 'pipeline'
  | 'decorator'
  | 'factoryMethod'
  | 'stateMachine'
  | 'commandTrace'
  | 'adapter'
  | 'repository'
  | 'visitor';
```

!! 有效签名判定

```ts
function isValidSignature(signature: ChantSignature): boolean {
  return (
    signatureIsAuthentic(signature) &&
    signatureHasSourceRef(signature) &&
    signatureHasLineage(signature) &&
    signatureOutputIsConsumed(signature) &&
    signatureInputOutputChanged(signature) &&
    !signatureIsRepeated(signature) &&
    signatureEventWindowIsFresh(signature) &&
    signaturePassesHiddenCase(signature)
  );
}
```

!! 可选效果匹配

平台读取魔法书配方，在签名链中匹配连续片段：

```ts
function matchOptionalEffects(
  signatures: ChantSignature[],
  recipe: SkillRecipe,
): MatchedEffect[] {
  const results: MatchedEffect[] = [];

  for (const effect of recipe.optionalEffects) {
    const matches = findSequences(signatures, effect.sequence, effect.constraints);
    results.push({ effectId: effect.id, matches });
  }

  return results;
}
```

!! 反投机

| 投机方式 | 防御机制 |
| 循环刷同类型签名 | 检查 `producer.objectId` 和 `inputHash/outputHash` |
| 空类堆叠 | 检查 `changesOutputHash` 和 `passesHiddenCase` |
| 复制旧签名 | 绑定 `sessionId/paramsHash/environmentHash` |
| 薄包装 | 检查 `sourceRef.functionLineCount` 和 `complexity` |
| 跳过血缘 | 检查 `lineage.consumedBy` |

